  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agro-econvert: Agroecological transition and organic certification in Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Policy roundtables: 
FAO will be charged to prepare and organise policy related events: 1 national final roundtable event (60 pax) + 2 stakeholder roundtables (potentially at provincial level if relevant) (30 pax). 
Policy engagement and dissemination (cooperation/networking): 
FAO will be tasked to provide close liaison with government counterparts, facilitation of an ongoing policy dialogue on upscaling of agroecology and certification.</narrative>
  </description>
